nsters with unique attack patterns, from giant swords that swing to attack you, to organs of pollution that drown you in clouds of smoke, to friendly hearts that share the gift of love with you (this gift is delivered in the form of a deadly laser)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 levels with unique benefits to be gained (uhm, technically, you can only<i> gain</i>\u00a039 levels because you start at level 1)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 gripping boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibly a few disappointing ones too</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two hundred cosmetic collectables to be acquired through our <span class=\"bb_strike\">slot machine</span>\u00a0loot box system which can be obtained by winning 10 battle royale games or by spending your parents' money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 bullet point directly above this one that is not actually true</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Wall, to be destroyed</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kingsnake Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398360/10ddc2ea911a122292f3075735f38212580918a1/header.jpg?t=1764129633","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> any distro with glibc 2.28 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual Core CPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics or AMD (formerly ATI) Radeon HD Graphics (Discrete): Nvidia GeForce 9600 GT or AMD Radeon HD 2400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 26 is guaran